  Description: "COMPANION / RARE / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nA recorded hero injury grants
    3 gold. Shared 2s cooldown; shares the rebate timer with TV Head. Multiple copies
    do not multiply the payout.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nCompanions / Attack speed:
    +4%\nCompanions / Damage: -3%\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units
    reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nAn apprentice surgeon
    whose tools also repaired coats. Their teacher called every error a moral failure.
    They seek colleagues who correct mistakes without demanding a confession of worthlessness.\r\nPERSONAL
    PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies
    and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level
    unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds:
    archive, resolve. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star
    bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
